The XML files in this directory are vendored protocol definitions. Each carries
its own copyright notice and licence text inside the file; they are reproduced
here unmodified.

  wayland.xml
      From wayland 1.23.1. Copyright © 2008-2011 Kristian Høgsberg and others.
      MIT (Expat).
      https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland

  xdg-shell.xml, viewporter.xml, linux-dmabuf-v1.xml, fractional-scale-v1.xml,
  xdg-decoration-unstable-v1.xml, xdg-output-unstable-v1.xml,
  text-input-unstable-v3.xml
      From wayland-protocols 1.38. MIT (Expat).
      https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland-protocols

  wlr-layer-shell-unstable-v1.xml, wlr-foreign-toplevel-management-unstable-v1.xml
      From wlr-protocols. Copyright © 2017 Drew DeVault and others.
      MIT-like; see the notice in each file.
      https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wlroots/wlr-protocols

They are inputs to tools/wlgen/wlgen.py, which generates
wayland/src/main/kotlin/dev/myarch/wayland/protocol/Protocols.kt. Only the
message names, opcodes, argument layouts and enum values are used; no
implementation code is derived from them.
